{"seq":3,"slug":"turbopack-and-farm","title":"Turbopack 与 Farm","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/turbopack-and-farm","wordCount":921,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"turbopack-与-farm\">Turbopack 与 Farm</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Turbopack 与 Farm 代表新一代构建框架的两条路线：Turbopack 以<strong>增量计算</strong>为核心理念，深度绑定 Next.js，文件变更时只重算受影响的最小范围；Farm 则用 Rust 从零实现一个独立的全功能框架，强调开发与生产的一致性。两者的共同背景是构建引擎的 Rust 化——用原生语言的性能与细粒度缓存，缓解大型项目上「改动一处、重算全局」的瓶颈。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"下一代构建框架的探索\">下一代构建框架的探索</h2><p>当 Webpack/Vite/Rspack 已经覆盖了大多数构建场景时，新一代构建框架仍在不断涌现。Turbopack 和 Farm 代表了两个不同的探索方向：Turbopack 选择深度集成于 Next.js 框架，以增量计算为核心理念；Farm 则是一个独立的全功能构建框架，用 Rust 从零实现，追求开发与生产的一致性体验。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"turbopack\">Turbopack</h2><h3 id=\"定位与背景\">定位与背景</h3><p>Turbopack 由 Vercel 团队开发，最初由 Webpack 的作者 Tobias Koppers 主导。它的设计目标不是替代 Webpack，而是为 Next.js 提供一个极速的开发构建引擎。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Turbopack 生态定位&#10;        NEXTJS[Next.js]&#10;        TURBOPACK[Turbopack&lt;br/&gt;增量引擎]&#10;        TURBO_ENGINE[Turbo Engine&lt;br/&gt;增量计算框架]&#10;        SWC_T[SWC&lt;br/&gt;代码转译]&#10;    end&#10;    NEXTJS --&gt; TURBOPACK&#10;    TURBOPACK --&gt; TURBO_ENGINE&#10;    TURBOPACK --&gt; SWC_T\">graph TB\n    subgraph Turbopack 生态定位\n        NEXTJS[Next.js]\n        TURBOPACK[Turbopack&lt;br/&gt;增量引擎]\n        TURBO_ENGINE[Turbo Engine&lt;br/&gt;增量计算框架]\n        SWC_T[SWC&lt;br/&gt;代码转译]\n    end\n    NEXTJS --&gt; TURBOPACK\n    TURBOPACK --&gt; TURBO_ENGINE\n    TURBOPACK --&gt; SWC_T</pre><h3 id=\"核心理念-增量计算\">核心理念：增量计算</h3><p>Turbopack 的核心创新是基于<strong>增量计算</strong>（Incremental Computation）的构建模型。传统打包器在文件变更时需要重新计算整个依赖链，而 Turbopack 只重新计算受影响的最小范围。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 传统打包器&#10;        CHANGE1[文件变更] --&gt; REBUILD[重新构建整个&lt;br/&gt;依赖子图]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Turbopack&#10;        CHANGE2[文件变更] --&gt; INVALIDATE[失效受影响的&lt;br/&gt;计算节点]&#10;        INVALIDATE --&gt; RECOMPUTE[只重算变更节点]&#10;        RECOMPUTE --&gt; CACHE_HIT[其他节点&lt;br/&gt;命中缓存]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 传统打包器\n        CHANGE1[文件变更] --&gt; REBUILD[重新构建整个&lt;br/&gt;依赖子图]\n    end\n    subgraph Turbopack\n        CHANGE2[文件变更] --&gt; INVALIDATE[失效受影响的&lt;br/&gt;计算节点]\n        INVALIDATE --&gt; RECOMPUTE[只重算变更节点]\n        RECOMPUTE --&gt; CACHE_HIT[其他节点&lt;br/&gt;命中缓存]\n    end</pre><p>这种模型在大型项目中优势尤为明显——当项目包含数千个模块时，单个文件的变更只需要几毫秒就能反映到浏览器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在-next-js-中使用\">在 Next.js 中使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// next.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  experimental: {&#10;    turbo: {&#10;      rules: {&#10;        &#39;*.svg&#39;: {&#10;          loaders: [&#39;@svgr/webpack&#39;],&#10;          as: &#39;*.js&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;      resolveAlias: {&#10;        &#39;@&#39;: &#39;./src&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// next.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  experimental: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    turbo: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '*.svg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          loaders: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@svgr/webpack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          as: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      resolveAlias: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"next dev --turbopack\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --turbopack</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"turbopack-的功能状态\">Turbopack 的功能状态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发服务器</td>\n<td>✅ 稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMR</td>\n<td>✅ 极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS Modules</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产构建</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webpack Loader 兼容</td>\n<td>⚠️ 部分兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立使用（非 Next.js）</td>\n<td>⚠️ 实验性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"架构特点\">架构特点</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Turbo Engine&#10;        TASK[Task Graph&lt;br/&gt;任务图]&#10;        CACHE[Persistent Cache&lt;br/&gt;持久化缓存]&#10;        PARALLEL[Parallel Execution&lt;br/&gt;并行执行]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Turbopack Layers&#10;        RESOLVE[Module Resolution]&#10;        TRANSFORM[Code Transform]&#10;        CHUNK[Chunk Generation]&#10;    end&#10;    TASK --&gt; RESOLVE&#10;    TASK --&gt; TRANSFORM&#10;    TASK --&gt; CHUNK&#10;    CACHE --&gt; TASK&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; TASK\">graph LR\n    subgraph Turbo Engine\n        TASK[Task Graph&lt;br/&gt;任务图]\n        CACHE[Persistent Cache&lt;br/&gt;持久化缓存]\n        PARALLEL[Parallel Execution&lt;br/&gt;并行执行]\n    end\n    subgraph Turbopack Layers\n        RESOLVE[Module Resolution]\n        TRANSFORM[Code Transform]\n        CHUNK[Chunk Generation]\n    end\n    TASK --&gt; RESOLVE\n    TASK --&gt; TRANSFORM\n    TASK --&gt; CHUNK\n    CACHE --&gt; TASK\n    PARALLEL --&gt; TASK</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"farm\">Farm</h2><h3 id=\"定位与背景\">定位与背景</h3><p>Farm 是一个用 Rust 编写的全功能构建框架，由国内开发者创建。与 Turbopack 深度绑定 Next.js 不同，Farm 是一个独立的通用构建工具，可以用于任何前端项目。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心特性\">核心特性</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Farm 核心特性&#10;        RUST[Rust 核心&lt;br/&gt;极速编译]&#10;        PARTIAL[Partial Bundling&lt;br/&gt;部分打包]&#10;        HMR_F[原生 HMR&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级更新]&#10;        PLUGIN_F[JS/Rust 插件&lt;br/&gt;双语言支持]&#10;        COMPAT[兼容性&lt;br/&gt;Vite 插件兼容]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Farm 核心特性\n        RUST[Rust 核心&lt;br/&gt;极速编译]\n        PARTIAL[Partial Bundling&lt;br/&gt;部分打包]\n        HMR_F[原生 HMR&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级更新]\n        PLUGIN_F[JS/Rust 插件&lt;br/&gt;双语言支持]\n        COMPAT[兼容性&lt;br/&gt;Vite 插件兼容]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"partial-bundling-部分打包\">Partial Bundling（部分打包）</h3><p>Farm 提出了<strong>部分打包</strong>（Partial Bundling）的概念，这是介于&quot;完全打包&quot;和&quot;完全不打包&quot;之间的折中方案：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 完全打包 - Webpack&#10;        ALL[所有模块] --&gt; ONE[1 个 Bundle]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 完全不打包 - Vite Dev&#10;        EACH[每个模块] --&gt; MANY[N 个请求]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 部分打包 - Farm&#10;        SMART[智能分组] --&gt; FEW[适量 Bundle&lt;br/&gt;20-30 个]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 完全打包 - Webpack\n        ALL[所有模块] --&gt; ONE[1 个 Bundle]\n    end\n    subgraph 完全不打包 - Vite Dev\n        EACH[每个模块] --&gt; MANY[N 个请求]\n    end\n    subgraph 部分打包 - Farm\n        SMART[智能分组] --&gt; FEW[适量 Bundle&lt;br/&gt;20-30 个]\n    end</pre><p>Farm 根据模块之间的依赖关系和访问模式，将模块智能分组为适量的 Bundle。这既避免了完全打包的长时间构建，又避免了完全不打包的网络瀑布流问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本配置\">基本配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// farm.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;@farmfe/core&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  compilation: {&#10;    input: {&#10;      index: &#39;./src/index.tsx&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    output: {&#10;      path: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;      publicPath: &#39;/&#39;,&#10;      targetEnv: &#39;browser&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    resolve: {&#10;      alias: {&#10;        &#39;@&#39;: &#39;./src&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;    minify: true,&#10;    sourcemap: true,&#10;    partialBundling: {&#10;      targetConcurrentRequests: 25,&#10;      targetMinSize: 20 * 1024,&#10;      targetMaxSize: 1500 * 1024,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  plugins: [&#39;@farmfe/plugin-react&#39;, &#39;@farmfe/plugin-sass&#39;],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// farm.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@farmfe/core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  compilation: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    input: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      index: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/index.tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      publicPath: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      targetEnv: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'browser'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resolve: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      alias: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    minify: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sourcemap: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    partialBundling: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      targetConcurrentRequests: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      targetMinSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      targetMaxSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@farmfe/plugin-react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@farmfe/plugin-sass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"vite-插件兼容\">Vite 插件兼容</h3><p>Farm 兼容大部分 Vite 插件，降低了迁移门槛：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineConfig } from &#39;@farmfe/core&#39;;&#10;import vitePluginSvgr from &#39;vite-plugin-svgr&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  vitePlugins: [vitePluginSvgr()],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@farmfe/core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vitePluginSvgr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vite-plugin-svgr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vitePlugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vitePluginSvgr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"turbopack-vs-farm-vs-vite-vs-rspack\">Turbopack vs Farm vs Vite vs Rspack</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Turbopack</th>\n<th>Farm</th>\n<th>Vite</th>\n<th>Rspack</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>JS (+ esbuild/Rollup)</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立使用</td>\n<td>⚠️ 实验性</td>\n<td>✅ 独立</td>\n<td>✅ 独立</td>\n<td>✅ 独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架绑定</td>\n<td>Next.js</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发模式</td>\n<td>增量计算</td>\n<td>部分打包</td>\n<td>原生 ESM</td>\n<td>Webpack 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产构建</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>Rust 原生</td>\n<td>Rollup</td>\n<td>Rspack</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webpack 兼容</td>\n<td>部分 Loader</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>高度兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vite 插件兼容</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>大部分兼容</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟度</td>\n<td>快速发展</td>\n<td>早期但活跃</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>Next.js 项目</td>\n<td>新项目/追求极速</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>Webpack 迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"如何选择构建框架\">如何选择构建框架</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START{你的项目类型?}&#10;    START --&gt;|Next.js 项目| TURBO[Turbopack]&#10;    START --&gt;|新建应用项目| NEW{对 Webpack 生态有依赖?}&#10;    START --&gt;|已有 Webpack 项目| RSBUILD[Rsbuild]&#10;    START --&gt;|构建 npm 库| RSLIB_CHOICE[Rslib]&#10;    NEW --&gt;|是| RSBUILD&#10;    NEW --&gt;|否| VITE_FARM{追求极致性能?}&#10;    VITE_FARM --&gt;|是| FARM_CHOICE[Farm]&#10;    VITE_FARM --&gt;|否| VITE_CHOICE[Vite]\">flowchart TD\n    START{你的项目类型?}\n    START --&gt;|Next.js 项目| TURBO[Turbopack]\n    START --&gt;|新建应用项目| NEW{对 Webpack 生态有依赖?}\n    START --&gt;|已有 Webpack 项目| RSBUILD[Rsbuild]\n    START --&gt;|构建 npm 库| RSLIB_CHOICE[Rslib]\n    NEW --&gt;|是| RSBUILD\n    NEW --&gt;|否| VITE_FARM{追求极致性能?}\n    VITE_FARM --&gt;|是| FARM_CHOICE[Farm]\n    VITE_FARM --&gt;|否| VITE_CHOICE[Vite]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Turbopack 以增量计算为核心，深度集成于 Next.js，开发模式下性能极佳。</li>\n<li>Farm 是独立的 Rust 构建框架，提出了 Partial Bundling 的创新策略。</li>\n<li>Farm 兼容 Vite 插件生态，降低了迁移成本。</li>\n<li>构建框架的选择应基于项目类型、团队技术栈和性能需求综合判断。</li>\n<li>Vite 和 Rsbuild 是当前最成熟的选择，Turbopack 和 Farm 代表了未来的探索方向。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Turbopack 与 Farm","id":"turbopack-与-farm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"下一代构建框架的探索","id":"下一代构建框架的探索"},{"level":2,"text":"Turbopack","id":"turbopack"},{"level":3,"text":"定位与背景","id":"定位与背景"},{"level":3,"text":"核心理念：增量计算","id":"核心理念-增量计算"},{"level":3,"text":"在 Next.js 中使用","id":"在-next-js-中使用"},{"level":3,"text":"Turbopack 的功能状态","id":"turbopack-的功能状态"},{"level":3,"text":"架构特点","id":"架构特点"},{"level":2,"text":"Farm","id":"farm"},{"level":3,"text":"定位与背景","id":"定位与背景"},{"level":3,"text":"核心特性","id":"核心特性"},{"level":3,"text":"Partial Bundling（部分打包）","id":"partial-bundling-部分打包"},{"level":3,"text":"基本配置","id":"基本配置"},{"level":3,"text":